Amazon Bedrock
Overview

Amazon Bedrock is a fully managed AWS service that provides access to foundation models (FMs) from different AI model providers through a unified AWS environment.

It allows developers to build and integrate Generative AI applications without having to manage the underlying infrastructure required to run the foundation models.

As part of BLA 01, I studied Amazon Bedrock and several of the concepts used when building Generative AI applications, including foundation models, model inference, APIs, Guardrails, embeddings, tokenization, and fine-tuning.

