Architecture / Design

Amazon Bedrock can be used as the AI service layer between an application and a foundation model.
An application can send a request to Amazon Bedrock through an API. Bedrock then interacts with the selected foundation model and returns the generated response to the application.
Additional capabilities such as Guardrails, embeddings, knowledge bases, RAG, and model customization can be incorporated depending on the requirements of the application.




