The Amazon Bedrock activity helped me understand how AWS can be used to build Generative AI applications without having to manage the underlying infrastructure for foundation models.
One of the most important things I learned was how several different concepts work together. Tokens and tokenization help explain how models process text, while embeddings allow information to be represented numerically and compared based on meaning.
